Package: zeltro-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cane Bay Computers <canebaycomputers@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: bash (>= 4.4), coreutils, git, curl, python3, jq, sed, gawk, openssl, acl
Recommends: docker.io | docker-ce
Homepage: https://zeltro.ai
Description: Pre-plumbed PHP, Python and Node dev environments for AI agents
 Zeltro is a Docker-based local development environment manager. Every project
 gets a fixed hostname, a shared database, cache and storage layer, and a
 container with the runtime and drivers already compiled in.
 .
 Docker is required but deliberately only Recommended: several packages provide
 it (docker.io, docker-ce, and vendor builds), and hard-depending on one would
 conflict with the others.
 .
 After installing, run 'zeltro configure' once.
